    "available": true,
    "excerpt": "Turn a 2D math problem — given as text or an image — into an interactive GeoGebra file. A host agent (Codex or DeepSeek Harness) reads the problem and writes a native Algebra/CAS program; this project runs it locally, verifies every stated condition, exports the .ggb, reloads it,"
